ALTMETRIC CHAMPION ONBOARDING
Status and Handover Document 
________________
1. Overview
Three Google Sites pages have been built to support Altmetric Explorer institution champion onboarding. Pages are deployed by Program Managers to champions in place of or alongside kick-off meetings. Champions work through the page at their own pace and submit the required form(s) to initiate access and integration setup.


Two of the three pages are optional: Page 1 is universal (sent to all champions), while Pages 2 and 3 are sent only when data integrations or badges are in scope for a given customer's contract.
