	1.2 How the pages are used
Program Managers share the relevant page link(s) with new institution champions. Page 1 is always shared. Pages 2 and 3 are shared only when the relevant scope item (data integration or badges) is included in the customer's contract.


Champions read through the page, prepare the required information, and submit the setup form to trigger configuration. The pages are designed to be self-sufficient — kickoff calls can be replaced using these forms..
1.3 Design system
All three pages use a consistent custom HTML embed design with the following elements:


* Background: dark purple #2A265A
* Card background: medium purple #353062
* Inset/callout background: light purple #3F396A
* Orange accent: #F1860B (used for section labels, action highlights)
* Blue accent: #0693E3 (used for links and info elements)
* Magenta accent: #931F6F
* Green accent: #A2C61C
* Font: Segoe UI (system stack)
* iframe fix: html { background: #2A265A; } and body { display: table; width: 100%; } on every block


The custom HTML is embedded directly inside Google Sites sections using the custom embed feature. No external hosting is required.


